WEBVTT

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:17.960
<i>Testing, testing.</i>

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:20.700
<i>Mic check, mic check.</i>

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:22.660
Bring those things over here.

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:23.500
- Okay!
- Okay!

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:25.630
Then, we'll start the introduction
music as we hit the lights.

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:26.630
- Okay.
- Okay.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:29.760
It's been a while since
you performed, huh?

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.060
Yes.

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:32.730
Let's do our best!

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:33.730
Yes!

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:45.430
<i>Well, thank you for waiting.</i>
<i>We are now opening the doors.</i>

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:50.000
<i>Seats are all reserved,</i>
<i>so please don't run.</i>

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:53.560
All right everyone,
let's work hard today too!

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:54.260
- All right!
- All right!

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:56.300
<i>Please show the tickets</i>
<i>to the attendants.</i>

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:07.530
<i>Was that the right thing to do?</i>

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.900
Here, thank you very much!

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:19.500
What the heck is this?!

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:23.300
<i>Looks like my power is back.</i>

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:25.060
<i>This was the right thing to do.</i>

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:29.900
<i>Besides...</i>
<i>I remember her with no problem.</i>

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:32.560
But...

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:37.460
What are you doing here?

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:38.300
Meroko!

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:40.400
Today's the fated day!

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:42.830
This is no time to be daydreaming.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.400
There's no stopping now
that we've made it here.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.600
We have to work hard
for Mitsuki today!

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:53.630
<i>That's right.</i>
<i>I must do what I can today.</i>

00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:56.060
You don't have to tell me.

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:58.760
We'll prevent her from dying,
no matter what!

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.460
Yes, that's the spirit!

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:05.430
But we don't know where
other Death Spirits may come from.

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:08.560
Just make sure not to
leave Mitsuki's side.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.730
I'll go check around.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:11.730
Okay.

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:12.430
Later.

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:15.600
<i>Takuto...</i>

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.630
<i>In every case,</i>

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:23.300
<i>we Death Spirits were destined to</i>
<i>be separated from Mitsuki today.</i>

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:25.860
<i>But we're trying to change that,</i>

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:29.400
<i>so it wouldn't surprise me if</i>
<i>we lose something else instead.</i>

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:34.230
<i>So we must not let Mitsuki die,</i>
<i>no matter what!</i>

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:38.100
It's beautiful.
When we tested it on stage,

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:41.000
it looked so pretty shining in the light.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:45.360
Oh, Meroko!
Look, look!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:49.230
Isn't this pretty?
I'll be singing in this dress!

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:55.630
Meroko, what's wrong?

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:59.730
Nothing. It's wonderful!
It's so beautiful!

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:02.530
It'll look really good on Full Moon.

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:03.230
Yes!

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:07.860
Man, I wish I could've worn this when
we were at the studio rehearsal.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:15.800
<i>What's gonna happen?</i>
<i>What's coming?</i>

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:24.700
<i>It doesn't matter what comes!</i>

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:29.630
<i>I won't give Mitsuki's life to</i>
<i>anyone no matter what!</i>

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.430
Hello Takuto.

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:34.730
How are you?

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:39.130
Hi!

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.400
Izumi...

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:42.900
Wow...

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:44.660
Don't look so scary.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:45.960
Is it you?

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:47.130
What are you talking about?

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.360
Is it you who's going
to take Mitsuki's life?

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:53.560
No way. There's no reason for me
to do such a thing.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:58.900
I can't get Mero to turn to me
even if I did that.

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:02.330
What is it?

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.160
Izumi, do you really like Meroko?

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:08.060
Why are you asking?

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:12.860
If you really like her, then why do you
do things that make her suffer?

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:16.430
I know...

00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:21.960
What you want to say is, that in true love
you should care for each other, right?

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:28.700
But I know that's just an illusion.
So I'm just testing her.

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:35.930
Besides, whatever you try to do,
Mikki's life will end today.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:39.800
Even if you don't do it,
someone else will come to do it anyway.

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:42.300
Fate won't change.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:43.960
The result is the same.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:46.560
There's no point in trying.

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:52.060
Izumi...

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:54.260
What is it?

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:58.630
Why do you think we
became Death Spirits?

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:03.030
It's a punishment for being careless
with our own lives.

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:11.300
Right. You must be right.
I didn't finish my life properly.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.530
But I am so disgusted now
for being forced to see

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.700
the death of someone
that I care about.

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:23.960
That's the punishment.
We became Death Spirits to suffer.

00:07:25.260 --> 00:07:26.260
Maybe you're right.

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:29.700
But I will prevent that destiny.

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:32.860
Nothing will start unless I move.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:36.560
You are an optimist.

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:39.160
It's just that you're too pessimistic.

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:41.430
You think so?

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:45.460
See you.

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:47.230
Izumi!

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:49.130
What?

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:50.760
Meroko is a good person.

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:54.130
I already know that.

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:58.530
Not only Meroko. There are people
that you can actually trust.

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:01.100
There's no need to test them.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.130
I think I got enough pictures
from this area.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:19.830
Then, let's head on in.

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:25.230
It's so amazing that this girl became
such a popular idol, isn't it?

00:08:25.260 --> 00:08:26.400
Totally!

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:30.800
I was like "huh?" back when she said
she was going to debut as a singer.

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:35.300
When I first saw the huge billboard of her,
I thought, "What?!"

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:37.100
Where is Mitsuki?

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:38.700
With her grandmother, I think.

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:44.030
There are so many people here.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:47.330
I wonder if Mitsuki was able
to find her friends.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.130
She should be fine.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:51.060
Oh, Ma'am, this way, this way!

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:53.360
Hello there!

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:58.700
I'll have two pamphlets, two necklaces
and two pen-lights as well, please.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:08:59.500
Sure!

00:08:59.630 --> 00:09:01.700
You really seem to know
what you're doing.

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:03.230
Oh, yes, of course!

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:06.230
I used to always come to shows
without your knowledge!

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:09.260
Is that so?

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:11.260
Well, not always.

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:12.830
It was just once in a while!
Just once in a while.

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:15.700
I really don't come to
shows that often.

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:21.360
Wow!

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:24.800
So many people came for me.

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:26.700
Meroko...

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:29.630
How does it look around the area?

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:30.560
Not much going on.

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:32.130
How about here?
Did anyone come?

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:35.160
No problem here.
No one has come here.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:36.360
Okay.

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:37.760
Takuto?

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:39.300
Did something happen?

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:41.700
What happened? What do you mean?

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:44.060
You're acting a bit strange.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:47.460
What are you saying?
Takuto is always like this.

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:51.530
It's starting!

00:09:52.030 --> 00:09:56.660
<i>Hello everybody!</i>
<i>Welcome to Full Moon's "Live"!</i>

00:09:56.700 --> 00:10:02.700
<i>Before Full Moon comes out in</i>
<i>just a little bit, let's get pumped!</i>

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:04.060
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:08.160
<i>Without further ado,</i>
<i>I'll introduce you to a wonderful guest!</i>

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:12.730
<i>She rushed over here for Full Moon!</i>
<i>Madoka Wakamatsu!</i>

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:16.200
<i>The song is, of course,</i>
<i>"Eternal Snow"!</i>

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:38.100
<i>How long has it been ever since</i>
<i>I fell in love with you?</i>

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:45.300
<i>My feelings just keep</i>
<i>getting stronger...</i>

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:47.030
She's so lively.

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:51.700
She's a clumsy one, but looks like
she's found her own way to live her life.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.060
Yes.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:59.860
Even if Madoka says all those things,
I think she likes Full Moon.

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:04.000
I think she gets the motivation
to work hard from Full Moon.

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:09.530
No, Madoka is someone who could sing
very well even if Full Moon didn't exist.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:13.000
Just look at her singing so happily.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:17.360
<i>Hold me tight.</i>

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:21.760
<i>If loving someone was</i>
<i>going to feel like this,</i>

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:26.500
<i>I wish I never found out</i>
<i>about love.</i>

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:28.860
I won't lose to her!

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:34.500
Because I'm singing the songs I love
so much, I'll sing happily like Madoka.

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:38.230
So I won't lose fighting
against my fate!

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:39.630
Mitsuki...

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:41.030
That's right!

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:46.330
We will support you too,
so defeat fate with your singing!

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:48.860
Thank you, Meroko.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:50.200
Mitsuki...

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:15.230
Dr. Herberd.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:17.460
We've been looking forward
to your visit.

00:12:17.700 --> 00:12:20.560
Today is the day, Mr. Wakaoji.

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:21.830
Yes.

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:23.330
<i>Today is the day.</i>

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:27.130
<i>Everything will finish today.</i>

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:31.100
<i>If Mitsuki is fine</i>
<i>after midnight tonight,</i>

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:32.630
<i>that means that we were able</i>
<i>to change her fate.</i>

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:36.200
<i>I will protect her till then,</i>
<i>no matter what.</i>

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:41.400
<i>So, Keichi, you must</i>
<i>succeed in the surgery.</i>

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:42.630
<i>Yes.</i>

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:43.860
<i>All right.</i>
<i>I'm counting on you.</i>

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:46.030
<i>Takuto!</i>

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:51.060
<i>After everything is finished</i>
<i>and tomorrow comes,</i>

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:52.900
<i>let's jam together again.</i>

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:54.830
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:12:58.660 --> 00:12:59.730
Okay, let's go!

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:01.630
Let me carry your luggage.

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:03.000
Oh, thank you.

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:07.300
<i>Thank you for</i>
<i>a lovely performance!</i>

00:13:07.560 --> 00:13:11.200
<i>By the way, what kind of artist</i>
<i>is Full Moon in your eyes, Madoka?</i>

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:15.400
<i>For me, she's someone</i>
<i>who's destined to be my rival!</i>

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:16.700
<i>I see.</i>

00:13:17.030 --> 00:13:18.760
<i>If I remember it correctly,</i>

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:21.860
<i>you were supposed to release a song</i>
<i>at the same time as Full Moon, right?</i>

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:26.760
<i>Yes! I actually kind of</i>
<i>got depressed then, but...</i>

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:28.230
<i>Oh, you did, Madoka?</i>

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:34.760
<i>I think people see me as someone</i>
<i>who says whatever comes to my mind,</i>

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:36.830
<i>but I am really a pretty</i>
<i>sensitive person.</i>

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:37.560
<i>Huh?</i>

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:39.300
Just listen to her.

00:13:39.530 --> 00:13:40.900
She's clearly gotten over it well.

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:43.360
<i>Well, that aside,</i>

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:44.860
<i>we will be looking forward to</i>
<i>everything you do in the future!</i>

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:46.260
- Izumi,
<i>- Yes, of course!</i>

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:47.930
- we're not going back yet?
<i>- That was Wakamatsu Madoka,</i>

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:48.960
- No.
<i>- everyone!</i>

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:51.160
- Why? Tell me why?
<i>- Thank you!</i>

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:53.600
Shut up, it's none
of your business.

00:13:57.460 --> 00:14:00.100
So, Mitsuki, it's almost time to go.

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:00.960
Okay!

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:04.530
Takuto, please turn me
into Full Moon.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.000
Are you okay?

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:07.030
Yes, I am!

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:09.460
I really want to sing now!

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.960
I want to sing to the entire world.

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:14.160
Got it.

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:25.760
N-No way!

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:27.830
She can't transform?

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:29.700
What happened, Meroko?

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:31.730
Takuto's power isn't working!

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:32.430
What?

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:34.430
What about the concert?

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:41.860
<i>Full Moon, long time no see.</i>
<i>Congratulations on your first live show.</i>

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:44.600
<i>Unfortunately,</i>
<i>I can't make it today,</i>

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:47.160
<i>but I will definitely come and</i>
<i>support you next time, so keep it up.</i>

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:50.400
<i>I look forward to seeing you again.</i>
<i>So long.</i>

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:54.900
<i>All right, that was</i>
<i>a video letter from Miss Komaki!</i>

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:57.860
<i>Now, Full Moon will finally</i>
<i>come out on stage soon!</i>

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.000
Takuto...

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:10.800
My power isn't enough.

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:16.000
The effect of the Flower of Forgetfulness
probably hasn't kicked in yet,

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:17.730
but once it starts working...

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:22.030
Damn it! Why can't I use my power
at such a critical moment?!

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.760
Just start working now!

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:30.560
That's okay if I can't transform
into Full Moon.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:31.360
- What?
- What?

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:35.160
I'll sing... just as my
12-year-old self.

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:36.960
But then...

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:39.030
I was able to become a singer

00:15:39.060 --> 00:15:41.900
because Takuto allowed me
to transform into Full Moon.

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:46.560
I was able to live a completely different
life from the one I used to live.

00:15:47.230 --> 00:15:50.200
So that's already more than enough.

00:15:52.530 --> 00:15:54.430
When is Full Moon coming out?

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:55.900
She's so late.

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:57.300
She's coming now!

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:58.330
Please!

00:15:58.500 --> 00:15:59.700
What should we do?

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:03.930
We'll take care of things here,
so please take care of the stage.

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:05.100
All right!

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:07.730
Mitsuki, you...

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:09.260
It's okay.

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:14.460
I can't project my voice as much,
but my desire to sing is all the same.

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:15.430
No!

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.800
Mitsuki, that's impossible.

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:23.200
Yeah, the audience is waiting for
Full Moon to come on stage now.

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:25.830
Ms. Oshige!

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:26.930
Where's Full Moon?

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:32.930
Okay. I'll fill the time.

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:36.860
<i>Hey everybody!</i>
<i>I don't think you're loud enough!</i>

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:40.360
<i>You've got to call Full Moon</i>
<i>in a much louder voice!</i>

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:45.730
- Full Moon!
- Full Moon!

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:49.260
But...

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:52.930
No one will understand that
you are Full Moon.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:54.630
Everyone will be confused.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:55.660
But...

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.700
Damn it! It's my fault.

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.830
- Meroko?
- You...

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:30.030
Here, Takuto.

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:32.060
What? What's this?

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:36.030
I'm giving you my power.

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:38.460
But if you do that...

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:43.000
Don't worry about me.
Please transform Mitsuki into Full Moon.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:47.530
This is the last time
she can sing as Full Moon.

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:49.360
Meroko...

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:53.100
- Full Moon, Full Moon, Full Moon!
- Full Moon, Full Moon, Full Moon!

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:57.900
This ring will lead
my power to you, Takuto.

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:00.260
We are going to join our power.

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:02.160
Thank you, Meroko.

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:06.560
You better be really grateful
for a young lady's hair.

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:09.400
I've given you my treasure.

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:11.130
Okay?

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:12.360
Meroko...

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:36.060
Let's go, Mitsuki!

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:37.000
But...

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:37.800
It's fine!

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:40.130
I won't lose.

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:43.500
I won't forget about you
no matter what, either!

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:56.500
- Full Moon, Full Moon!
- Full Moon, Full Moon!

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:14.500
<i>How long has it been</i>
<i>since I fell in love with you?</i>

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:23.630
<i>My feelings keep getting stronger.</i>

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:43.400
<i>They're silent like the snow,</i>
<i>but they keep building up.</i>

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:53.600
<i>Hold me tight. If loving someone</i>
<i>was going to feel like this,</i>

00:19:53.630 --> 00:20:02.800
<i>I wish I never found out about love.</i>

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:10.930
<i>I love you, my tears won't stop.</i>

00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:24.800
<i>If this is how it's going to be,</i>
<i>I wish I had never met you.</i>

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:33.900
<i>- If the snow falls forever,</i>
- I... I...

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:40.830
<i>- will I be able to let go</i>
- Who am I?

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:43.860
<i>- of these thoughts of you?</i>
- Your name is Takuto.

00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:48.630
Takuto? Why am I here?

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:51.060
Because...

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:58.330
Because you're going to
make new memories.

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:01.700
New memories...

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:06.860
<i>I love you.</i>

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:11.460
<i>The feeling of love fills my heart...</i>

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:19.560
<i>I want to scream in the winter sky</i>
<i>that I want to see you right now.</i>

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:24.900
This is my first listen,
but her song is really good.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:25.600
Yeah.

00:23:06.630 --> 00:23:11.000
It's a really good song.
Hey, what's her name?

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:15.400
She's Full Moon.
No, she's Mitsuki.

00:23:15.800 --> 00:23:17.130
Mitsuki?

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:20.960
Yes. She's the girl you threw
everything away to protect.

00:23:21.160 --> 00:23:22.360
I protected her?

00:23:22.560 --> 00:23:27.030
Here, this is her last song.
We have to listen.

00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:28.030
Yeah.

00:23:28.860 --> 00:23:32.200
Next time on the final episode of Full Moon:
"Looking for the Full Moon."

00:23:32.630 --> 00:23:33.630
- Look forward to it!
- Look forward to it!
